(2750773, 383468, 61818, '<td valign="top">I''m all for nudes but this one doesn''t work for me.  The soft focus that could make this form really glow comes across more like noise on the background.  I think having the model centered would also have made more of an impact even if it meant moving her ''pistol'' hand over to the center of her body.  Sorry, I think I know the photog here and I''m a pretty big fan of your stuff but this one just doesn''t have the mojo.  Very drab overall.  Might have played up the drab with a more emotive sort of pose.  What if she held the hand gun to her head?  Seriously, that would have filled the void to the left of her head and really worked with the feeling of depression that the soft focus and colors are creating.  Anyway, nice shot (no pun ;) ).</td>', 'I''m all for nudes but this one doesn''t work for me.  The soft focus that could make this form really glow comes across more like noise on the background.  I think having the model centered would also have made more of an impact even if it meant moving her ''pistol'' hand over to the center of her body.  Sorry, I think I know the photog here and I''m a pretty big fan of your stuff but this one just doesn''t have the mojo.  Very drab overall.  Might have played up the drab with a more emotive sort of pose.  What if she held the hand gun to her head?  Seriously, that would have filled the void to the left of her head and really worked with the feeling of depression that the soft focus and colors are creating.  Anyway, nice shot (no pun ;) ).', '2006-08-23 01:50:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2750779, 383629, 47205, '<td valign="top">Love the color</td>', 'Love the color', '2006-08-23 01:51:40.000000', NULL, 1),
