(2751512, 383468, 35322, '<td valign="top">Excellent! I just love this picture. The rule of thirds and the focus only on the hand works like a charm. Every time I look at the picture I can imagine a different story behind it. The fact that you do not realy see the expression on the face, makes you wonder if she is smiling or not. It just gives you a feeling of intimacy, like a game between two lovers. Added to favourites</td>', 'Excellent! I just love this picture. The rule of thirds and the focus only on the hand works like a charm. Every time I look at the picture I can imagine a different story behind it. The fact that you do not realy see the expression on the face, makes you wonder if she is smiling or not. It just gives you a feeling of intimacy, like a game between two lovers. Added to favourites', '2006-08-23 07:12:25.000000', NULL, 1),
