(2752046, 383757, 47704, '<td valign="top">Well, this won''t win the Brownie but it will come close.  The lighting is absolutely horrible.  Way too harsh and has blown out the bottom left of the pic.  The strawberries on that metal background just destroyed it.  Wood would have been a better match - or ceramic.  1</td>', 'Well, this won''t win the Brownie but it will come close.  The lighting is absolutely horrible.  Way too harsh and has blown out the bottom left of the pic.  The strawberries on that metal background just destroyed it.  Wood would have been a better match - or ceramic.  1', '2006-08-23 10:21:12.000000', NULL, 1),
