(2752079, 381649, 15711, '<td valign="top">To me, this is just blurred and not soft focus.  I don''t really see a subject with a diffused type glow, which would define it for me. I''d probably remove that vivid bright blur frame as well. The simple white one would suffice, or maybe none at all. I''m sure the sunset is beautiful in focus. Hope this is helpful. ;~D</td>', 'To me, this is just blurred and not soft focus.  I don''t really see a subject with a diffused type glow, which would define it for me. I''d probably remove that vivid bright blur frame as well. The simple white one would suffice, or maybe none at all. I''m sure the sunset is beautiful in focus. Hope this is helpful. ;~D', '2006-08-23 10:27:32.000000', NULL, 1),
