(2752104, 383028, 58330, '<td valign="top">Very nice mood. Timeless.</td>', 'Very nice mood. Timeless.', '2006-08-23 10:31:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2752105, 383446, 15711, '<td valign="top">Sweet photos. I wonder if it couldn''t have a bit more diffused look to really give it the soft focus. Nice composition. (psst - I''d have the mom take off the bright red nail polish). I like the hint of sparkle on his ring, her necklace and earrings. The crop seems a tad tight at the top and on the left. Maybe a touch more negative (white) space would have worked better, in my eye.</td>', 'Sweet photos. I wonder if it couldn''t have a bit more diffused look to really give it the soft focus. Nice composition. (psst - I''d have the mom take off the bright red nail polish). I like the hint of sparkle on his ring, her necklace and earrings. The crop seems a tad tight at the top and on the left. Maybe a touch more negative (white) space would have worked better, in my eye.', '2006-08-23 10:31:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2752106, 383446, 30637, '<td valign="top">Beautiful picture. I think it would look nicer if the nail polish matched the lips and other skin tones.</td>', 'Beautiful picture. I think it would look nicer if the nail polish matched the lips and other skin tones.', '2006-08-23 10:31:35.000000', NULL, 1),
