(2752721, 383243, 52336, '<td valign="top">In my view, this is exactly the definition of a soft focus image.  Truly beautiful, suggesting the softness and delicacy of the subject.  Only quibble is the "eyetrap" that is the highlight on her hair clip.  Otherwise, focus, subject, composition, contrasts, and duotone are top-notch.  Almost redolent of Keith Carter.  So very well done. 9</td>', 'In my view, this is exactly the definition of a soft focus image.  Truly beautiful, suggesting the softness and delicacy of the subject.  Only quibble is the "eyetrap" that is the highlight on her hair clip.  Otherwise, focus, subject, composition, contrasts, and duotone are top-notch.  Almost redolent of Keith Carter.  So very well done. 9', '2006-08-23 13:43:39.000000', NULL, 1),
