(2752727, 382786, 52336, '<td valign="top">A lovely photograph, and a pretty subject.  She is a tad underexposed for me, and the background is a bit too busy for a soft focus image.  The soft focus portion looks to have been achieved with post work, as opposed to with your camera (forgive me if wrong).  Otherwise, composition works well, and subject''s expression is great.</td>', 'A lovely photograph, and a pretty subject.  She is a tad underexposed for me, and the background is a bit too busy for a soft focus image.  The soft focus portion looks to have been achieved with post work, as opposed to with your camera (forgive me if wrong).  Otherwise, composition works well, and subject''s expression is great.', '2006-08-23 13:45:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2752729, 381405, 13759, '<td valign="top">It´s simply shallow DOF a bit out of focus, not a soft focus.</td>', 'It´s simply shallow DOF a bit out of focus, not a soft focus.', '2006-08-23 13:46:03.000000', NULL, 1),
