(2753017, 384120, 61818, '<td valign="top">Don''t care for the title, but assuming it is true...<br/> <br/>If you tried to make this photo soft focus at all, you need to increase the effect.  This is a very nice picture for this challenge because the softer focus would make those flower colors and the snow on the mountain have a nice glow, giving the whole picture a very dreamy look which would work well with your subject matter here.  It would please my eye a bit more if the peak of the mountain was pushed over to the right edge of the shot and the slope came down from there.  This is not a bad picture though, so look forward to seeing you get even better.</td>', 'Don''t care for the title, but assuming it is true... If you tried to make this photo soft focus at all, you need to increase the effect.  This is a very nice picture for this challenge because the softer focus would make those flower colors and the snow on the mountain have a nice glow, giving the whole picture a very dreamy look which would work well with your subject matter here.  It would please my eye a bit more if the peak of the mountain was pushed over to the right edge of the shot and the slope came down from there.  This is not a bad picture though, so look forward to seeing you get even better.', '2006-08-23 15:10:08.000000', NULL, 1),
