(2754961, 383817, 62187, '<td valign="top">Good Lord - why do you do this to me!?!?!?! Why are you just staring at me? Stand up or something. I''m at a point in my DPC life that I''m thinking if you can''t beat ''em, join ''em. Ok, if you''re just going to sit there I''m going to give you a 9 (because I want the Eagle photo to win) and move on. I''ll check back later to see if you''ve moved any...</td>', 'Good Lord - why do you do this to me!?!?!?! Why are you just staring at me? Stand up or something. I''m at a point in my DPC life that I''m thinking if you can''t beat ''em, join ''em. Ok, if you''re just going to sit there I''m going to give you a 9 (because I want the Eagle photo to win) and move on. I''ll check back later to see if you''ve moved any...', '2006-08-23 23:28:41.000000', NULL, 1),
