(2755839, 382180, 64462, '<td valign="top">beautiful white!</td>', 'beautiful white!', '2006-08-24 04:45:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2755842, 384161, 16004, '<td valign="top">oh, this is lovely.  and the soft focus is used subtly and really effectively here, with a certain style that really brings out the image.  it''s beautiful; definetly has immediate wow impact.  though, the more i study it, the more that it feels it isn''t entirely natural - there is something i can''t place that is not quite right about the middle taller flowers...  the background is lovely, really compliments the colours of the subjects.  9.</td>', 'oh, this is lovely.  and the soft focus is used subtly and really effectively here, with a certain style that really brings out the image.  it''s beautiful; definetly has immediate wow impact.  though, the more i study it, the more that it feels it isn''t entirely natural - there is something i can''t place that is not quite right about the middle taller flowers...  the background is lovely, really compliments the colours of the subjects.  9.', '2006-08-24 04:49:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2755843, 383217, 64462, '<td valign="top">i like the idea! and car keyes - wahaha - the best pick for the soft focus theme!)</td>', 'i like the idea! and car keyes - wahaha - the best pick for the soft focus theme!)', '2006-08-24 04:51:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2755844, 381838, 16004, '<td valign="top">really nice portrait, though it does feel a little dark and grey for my own tastes.  but credit is due for great composition, and for capturing the bride in a great motion-esque pose.  the background sets the whole thing off very nicely.  it''s quite the captivating image - 9.</td>', 'really nice portrait, though it does feel a little dark and grey for my own tastes.  but credit is due for great composition, and for capturing the bride in a great motion-esque pose.  the background sets the whole thing off very nicely.  it''s quite the captivating image - 9.', '2006-08-24 04:51:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2755846, 382721, 63970, '<td valign="top">Cool shot!</td>', 'Cool shot!', '2006-08-24 04:53:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2755847, 383566, 16004, '<td valign="top">this is a weird image - i''ve never seen or even heard of this rainbow phenomon.  to be honest, i think i might be more impressed with the picture if it were just of the land mass, the plane feeling somewhat of an unattractive distraction.  sorry.  4.</td>', 'this is a weird image - i''ve never seen or even heard of this rainbow phenomon.  to be honest, i think i might be more impressed with the picture if it were just of the land mass, the plane feeling somewhat of an unattractive distraction.  sorry.  4.', '2006-08-24 04:54:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2755851, 382333, 63970, '<td valign="top">Deeper colors would be nice.  Concept is there.</td>', 'Deeper colors would be nice.  Concept is there.', '2006-08-24 04:58:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2755852, 383654, 63970, '<td valign="top">LOL... great title.</td>', 'LOL... great title.', '2006-08-24 04:59:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2755855, 383059, 16004, '<td valign="top">as a piece of photographic art, i like this a lot.  it is a great shot of america, and has an almighty sense of dated realness in a 1970''s polaroid kind of way...  whether or not it''s good for this particular challenge, i am not entirely sure.  in some respects, the focus seems either a bit too sharp (the lamp posts, for example), or where it doesn''t, seems too out of focus to be considered soft (traffic lights and trees).  but i like it!  i like the splashes of gold on the left, the shiny areas on the tarmac, the droplets on the glass.  so much character, so much to look at.  so 7 overall.</td>', 'as a piece of photographic art, i like this a lot.  it is a great shot of america, and has an almighty sense of dated realness in a 1970''s polaroid kind of way...  whether or not it''s good for this particular challenge, i am not entirely sure.  in some respects, the focus seems either a bit too sharp (the lamp posts, for example), or where it doesn''t, seems too out of focus to be considered soft (traffic lights and trees).  but i like it!  i like the splashes of gold on the left, the shiny areas on the tarmac, the droplets on the glass.  so much character, so much to look at.  so 7 overall.', '2006-08-24 05:10:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2755859, 382224, 63970, '<td valign="top">Would have likeed to have seen the rails as vertical.  Unique and good "soft focus"</td>', 'Would have likeed to have seen the rails as vertical.  Unique and good "soft focus"', '2006-08-24 05:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2755860, 382190, 16004, '<td valign="top">what a gloriously gorgeous still life this is!  it would never occur to me to go for such an almost outlandish hue, but it looks fantastic and is a great choice.  the arrangement of the flowers, the lighting and the application of softness works wonderfully well here, and you should be applauded for a wonderful shot.  even the droopy flower at the back doesn''t unbalance things; making the shot more asymmetrical adds greater realism and makes it more natural.  a perfect, beautiful image, and fits the challenge wondrously. 10.</td>', 'what a gloriously gorgeous still life this is!  it would never occur to me to go for such an almost outlandish hue, but it looks fantastic and is a great choice.  the arrangement of the flowers, the lighting and the application of softness works wonderfully well here, and you should be applauded for a wonderful shot.  even the droopy flower at the back doesn''t unbalance things; making the shot more asymmetrical adds greater realism and makes it more natural.  a perfect, beautiful image, and fits the challenge wondrously. 10.', '2006-08-24 05:23:26.000000', NULL, 1),
