(2756578, 382322, 63163, '<td valign="top">I know the focus of the picture is the girl, but I''m a horse person, and I''m sorry if I sound to critical.  I think the picture would of looked more pleasing if the saddle pad was clean.  If it is a clean pad, I would of tacked up with a white one.<br/> <br/>Heather Brown</td>', 'I know the focus of the picture is the girl, but I''m a horse person, and I''m sorry if I sound to critical.  I think the picture would of looked more pleasing if the saddle pad was clean.  If it is a clean pad, I would of tacked up with a white one. Heather Brown', '2006-08-24 11:40:40.000000', NULL, 1),
