(2759391, 384085, 62671, '<td valign="top">What a fantastic collection!  You have quite a few items that are begging to be shot more closely with less ''stuff'' with them.  This feels a bit to cluttered and busy to me.  Im also not crazy about the noise at the edges of the light.  However, it does add to the old feel.  I would think there would be grain overall and not just in those locations.  I love the old table top that you have them on, it fits the scene well.   I think there is also to much black empty space above.  I wish I could borrow a few of those items! the focus is perfectly soft to fit the theme.</td>', 'What a fantastic collection!  You have quite a few items that are begging to be shot more closely with less ''stuff'' with them.  This feels a bit to cluttered and busy to me.  Im also not crazy about the noise at the edges of the light.  However, it does add to the old feel.  I would think there would be grain overall and not just in those locations.  I love the old table top that you have them on, it fits the scene well.   I think there is also to much black empty space above.  I wish I could borrow a few of those items! the focus is perfectly soft to fit the theme.', '2006-08-25 10:58:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2759392, 384044, 54866, '<td valign="top">Not very thrilled about the frame. I don''t think it improves the picture, which is very good.</td>', 'Not very thrilled about the frame. I don''t think it improves the picture, which is very good.', '2006-08-25 10:58:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2759397, 381726, 16004, '<td valign="top">rather than a subtle warm feeling you get with a soft blur, I really get a sense of a heavily processed image where the noise reduction has been done at full, especially in the grassy areas.  that''s the immediate thing i noticed.  however, after a longer viewing, lots of qualities come to light; i actually really like the high contrast bright and bold colours.  i like how she''s posing with her eyes shut and arms outward, both of which is different to the norm.  i love the lighting.  the butterfly make up is a bit unnecessary to be honest; it certainly doesn''t add anything (your model has dreamy drama all over her), and has the unfortunate effect of making her appearance of either a burn victim or of someone seriously deprived of sleep.  but it is slightly mad, and i agree with the title, very dreamlike.  7.</td>', 'rather than a subtle warm feeling you get with a soft blur, I really get a sense of a heavily processed image where the noise reduction has been done at full, especially in the grassy areas.  that''s the immediate thing i noticed.  however, after a longer viewing, lots of qualities come to light; i actually really like the high contrast bright and bold colours.  i like how she''s posing with her eyes shut and arms outward, both of which is different to the norm.  i love the lighting.  the butterfly make up is a bit unnecessary to be honest; it certainly doesn''t add anything (your model has dreamy drama all over her), and has the unfortunate effect of making her appearance of either a burn victim or of someone seriously deprived of sleep.  but it is slightly mad, and i agree with the title, very dreamlike.  7.', '2006-08-25 11:00:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2759400, 383629, 54866, '<td valign="top">Are those colors right? I love this, looks like a postcard from Gandalf.</td>', 'Are those colors right? I love this, looks like a postcard from Gandalf.', '2006-08-25 11:01:29.000000', NULL, 1),
