(2759418, 383560, 44453, '<td valign="top">I think you could have got away with having the foreground not quite so soft focus - for me the soft trees and mist are enough and the logs aren''t quite as nice.  I like the overall feeling of a painting, sort of like a Arthur Streeton</td>', 'I think you could have got away with having the foreground not quite so soft focus - for me the soft trees and mist are enough and the logs aren''t quite as nice.  I like the overall feeling of a painting, sort of like a Arthur Streeton', '2006-08-25 11:08:10.000000', NULL, 1),
