(2759530, 381955, 62671, '<td valign="top">The sky is to bland to have that much of it in the image.  Tilt the camera down to bring the horizon to the upper 1/3 line an show more of the foreground which would stretch the distance of the fence.  It would also give you a triangle  that would lead your eye to the barn and tree.  You could also lower the camera closer to the ground to virtually eliminate the roof and bring the tree more into the scene.  I like the misty feel of the morning.</td>', 'The sky is to bland to have that much of it in the image.  Tilt the camera down to bring the horizon to the upper 1/3 line an show more of the foreground which would stretch the distance of the fence.  It would also give you a triangle  that would lead your eye to the barn and tree.  You could also lower the camera closer to the ground to virtually eliminate the roof and bring the tree more into the scene.  I like the misty feel of the morning.', '2006-08-25 12:07:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2759532, 383977, 22734, '<td valign="top">Very lovely. The high color accents on the green subtract a bit from the otherwise perfect visual. 7</td>', 'Very lovely. The high color accents on the green subtract a bit from the otherwise perfect visual. 7', '2006-08-25 12:08:02.000000', NULL, 1),
