(2765194, 384085, 64636, '<td valign="top">very nostalgic!  I like the addition of the bear because it adds the element of youth to capture the life across it''s span, however, there is something quite distracting about the bear!</td>', 'very nostalgic!  I like the addition of the bear because it adds the element of youth to capture the life across it''s span, however, there is something quite distracting about the bear!', '2006-08-27 21:32:18.000000', NULL, 1),
