(2765249, 383622, 64636, '<td valign="top">I love the colour but found the reflection just a little too overpowering.</td>', 'I love the colour but found the reflection just a little too overpowering.', '2006-08-27 21:45:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2765254, 381686, 64636, '<td valign="top">very nice</td>', 'very nice', '2006-08-27 21:47:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2765259, 383364, 20956, '<td valign="top">out of focus even for soft focus.</td>', 'out of focus even for soft focus.', '2006-08-27 21:48:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2765261, 382658, 20956, '<td valign="top">I like the green on green.</td>', 'I like the green on green.', '2006-08-27 21:49:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2765266, 384081, 20956, '<td valign="top">Tissue is overexposed, making it hard to see the detail in the white.</td>', 'Tissue is overexposed, making it hard to see the detail in the white.', '2006-08-27 21:50:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2765268, 384147, 20956, '<td valign="top">Majority of the picture is very dark.</td>', 'Majority of the picture is very dark.', '2006-08-27 21:50:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2765271, 383725, 20956, '<td valign="top">The white of the flower is overexposed.</td>', 'The white of the flower is overexposed.', '2006-08-27 21:51:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2765275, 381794, 20956, '<td valign="top">The whole picture is overexposed. I do not know if this was on purpose but I like that, almost like a white on white.</td>', 'The whole picture is overexposed. I do not know if this was on purpose but I like that, almost like a white on white.', '2006-08-27 21:53:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2765284, 382184, 20956, '<td valign="top">I do not know if this is the best subject for a soft focus photo. Being the photo is black and white the plants in foreground all wash together. Then the other half the photo is the clouds which seem the same. So it looks like two separate photos combined.</td>', 'I do not know if this is the best subject for a soft focus photo. Being the photo is black and white the plants in foreground all wash together. Then the other half the photo is the clouds which seem the same. So it looks like two separate photos combined.', '2006-08-27 21:56:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2765286, 384097, 20956, '<td valign="top">It looks like the grasshopper is glowing. The photo was over exposed or over sharpened or something.</td>', 'It looks like the grasshopper is glowing. The photo was over exposed or over sharpened or something.', '2006-08-27 21:57:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2765290, 383633, 20956, '<td valign="top">The subject is to far away to be effective. Those branches in the foreground on the left and bottom are distracting.</td>', 'The subject is to far away to be effective. Those branches in the foreground on the left and bottom are distracting.', '2006-08-27 21:58:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2765293, 384138, 20956, '<td valign="top">The soft focus is out of focus. The flowers are oversaturated.</td>', 'The soft focus is out of focus. The flowers are oversaturated.', '2006-08-27 21:59:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2765296, 383726, 20956, '<td valign="top">It is hard to find what is if anything is soft focused. Too much sand in the photo. Crop closer.</td>', 'It is hard to find what is if anything is soft focused. Too much sand in the photo. Crop closer.', '2006-08-27 22:00:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2765298, 381563, 20956, '<td valign="top">Nice crop.</td>', 'Nice crop.', '2006-08-27 22:01:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2765303, 382709, 20956, '<td valign="top">The colors are a little washed out but nice.</td>', 'The colors are a little washed out but nice.', '2006-08-27 22:02:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2765304, 382077, 20956, '<td valign="top">A little over exposed.</td>', 'A little over exposed.', '2006-08-27 22:03:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2765307, 381541, 20956, '<td valign="top">I like this because it does not look like the other 1000 flower pictures in this contest. The fence draws your attention right to the flower. Nice focus. Good job.</td>', 'I like this because it does not look like the other 1000 flower pictures in this contest. The fence draws your attention right to the flower. Nice focus. Good job.', '2006-08-27 22:05:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2765321, 383560, 20956, '<td valign="top">It is hard tell because of the soft focus but the photo seems to be out of focus, especially when you look at the logs in the foreground. Your post-processing makes it look like a painting and not a photograph. The composition is nice but work on the details before shooting the photo.</td>', 'It is hard tell because of the soft focus but the photo seems to be out of focus, especially when you look at the logs in the foreground. Your post-processing makes it look like a painting and not a photograph. The composition is nice but work on the details before shooting the photo.', '2006-08-27 22:11:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2765327, 384033, 20956, '<td valign="top">Be careful on your point of focus. It looks like the point of focus is her feet and not her face, as this should be the clearest part of the photo.</td>', 'Be careful on your point of focus. It looks like the point of focus is her feet and not her face, as this should be the clearest part of the photo.', '2006-08-27 22:13:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2765330, 383658, 20956, '<td valign="top">To much light from the right side causing that part of your subjects face to wash out.</td>', 'To much light from the right side causing that part of your subjects face to wash out.', '2006-08-27 22:15:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2765333, 383753, 20956, '<td valign="top">To dark. No subject to draw your attention.</td>', 'To dark. No subject to draw your attention.', '2006-08-27 22:16:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2765336, 382616, 20956, '<td valign="top">Nice but I''m not sure that dark landscapes are the best friend to show soft focus.</td>', 'Nice but I''m not sure that dark landscapes are the best friend to show soft focus.', '2006-08-27 22:18:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2765338, 383850, 20956, '<td valign="top">Sometimes blurr is nice but it does not work here.</td>', 'Sometimes blurr is nice but it does not work here.', '2006-08-27 22:18:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2765344, 383975, 20956, '<td valign="top">To much back ground. It is like the picture is two halves, a person and a gray background. I think this would look better if the left side of the crop was just to include her ear. The top of the crop just above the eyes. And then only about a 1/4 inch of gray on the right side.</td>', 'To much back ground. It is like the picture is two halves, a person and a gray background. I think this would look better if the left side of the crop was just to include her ear. The top of the crop just above the eyes. And then only about a 1/4 inch of gray on the right side.', '2006-08-27 22:22:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2765347, 381585, 20956, '<td valign="top">Ok but, crop in closer to get rid of most of the background.</td>', 'Ok but, crop in closer to get rid of most of the background.', '2006-08-27 22:23:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2765348, 383179, 20956, '<td valign="top">Seems to be a lot of noise and is very dark.</td>', 'Seems to be a lot of noise and is very dark.', '2006-08-27 22:24:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2765350, 382360, 20956, '<td valign="top">Soft focus not out of focus.</td>', 'Soft focus not out of focus.', '2006-08-27 22:24:34.000000', NULL, 1),
