(2766944, 384094, 61191, '<td valign="top">Wow, this is beautiful! The lighting is great, her skin looks really soft. I love her face. What distracts me are those reflections from the shoes on her backside. Why isn''t she barefoot? If she''d kicked off her shoes the shot would have a more intimate atmosphere. Anyway: well done! 9</td>', 'Wow, this is beautiful! The lighting is great, her skin looks really soft. I love her face. What distracts me are those reflections from the shoes on her backside. Why isn''t she barefoot? If she''d kicked off her shoes the shot would have a more intimate atmosphere. Anyway: well done! 9', '2006-08-28 07:47:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2766952, 384177, 61191, '<td valign="top">Is this a swing? I wonder if you made this for the "rope" challenge...<br/>Anyway: this would work better if the rope was tightened to underline the "limited mobility". I would try to take this shot bottom-up just infront of that place, where the rope meets the sand.</td>', 'Is this a swing? I wonder if you made this for the "rope" challenge...Anyway: this would work better if the rope was tightened to underline the "limited mobility". I would try to take this shot bottom-up just infront of that place, where the rope meets the sand.', '2006-08-28 07:53:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2766953, 382055, 61191, '<td valign="top">Oh, I love this misty mornings. Great!</td>', 'Oh, I love this misty mornings. Great!', '2006-08-28 07:53:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2766961, 383384, 61191, '<td valign="top">Nice idea. The problem here is the image quality: there are lots of artifacts in this shot, detail is lost. I think you used a low jpeg-quality. Try a higher one next time!</td>', 'Nice idea. The problem here is the image quality: there are lots of artifacts in this shot, detail is lost. I think you used a low jpeg-quality. Try a higher one next time!', '2006-08-28 07:56:41.000000', NULL, 1);
