(2771680, 382322, 24454, '<td valign="top">My favorite so far!!!   I love the soft whites, and it sure doesn''t hurt thatyou have that flawless, gorgeous face as your model!   I really love this one!  9</td>', 'My favorite so far!!!   I love the soft whites, and it sure doesn''t hurt thatyou have that flawless, gorgeous face as your model!   I really love this one!  9', '2006-08-29 23:00:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2771691, 384064, 24454, '<td valign="top">Very nice!  One of the few here that truly look beautifully soft focused rather than just blurry!    Fantastic job.  One of my favorites so far.</td>', 'Very nice!  One of the few here that truly look beautifully soft focused rather than just blurry!    Fantastic job.  One of my favorites so far.', '2006-08-29 23:03:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2771696, 383176, 24454, '<td valign="top">Oh this is AWESOME!   Soft Focus to perfection!  One of the few here where the soft focus enhances the photo rather than just making it look blurry!   I love it!</td>', 'Oh this is AWESOME!   Soft Focus to perfection!  One of the few here where the soft focus enhances the photo rather than just making it look blurry!   I love it!', '2006-08-29 23:04:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2771703, 382661, 24454, '<td valign="top">Ohmygosh, is that a teeny tiny little hummingbird???????   I am in awe!    I don''t know that I''ve ever, even in photos, seen one still.   This is incredible just for the uniqueness of it.    Technically, it may not be absolutely perfect because the leaves are a little overpowering and cover up part of the little bird, but because of the "coolness" (I know, new word) of the capture. ..it gets a 10 from me!!    Awesome photo to have in your collection!  10</td>', 'Ohmygosh, is that a teeny tiny little hummingbird???????   I am in awe!    I don''t know that I''ve ever, even in photos, seen one still.   This is incredible just for the uniqueness of it.    Technically, it may not be absolutely perfect because the leaves are a little overpowering and cover up part of the little bird, but because of the "coolness" (I know, new word) of the capture. ..it gets a 10 from me!!    Awesome photo to have in your collection!  10', '2006-08-29 23:06:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2771715, 384118, 53147, '<td valign="top">Bet you are getting alot of those "another kid shot" comments. I like this myself. The lighting and color tones along with the softness give this a great dreamy feel to it. Nice title as well. Bumping up. Back to bump up on emore time before rollover.</td>', 'Bet you are getting alot of those "another kid shot" comments. I like this myself. The lighting and color tones along with the softness give this a great dreamy feel to it. Nice title as well. Bumping up. Back to bump up on emore time before rollover.', '2006-08-29 23:10:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2771717, 382368, 53147, '<td valign="top">The softness and lighting gives this shot a great dreamy feel to it. Very ncie work. Bumping up. Back to bump up one more time - my top pick of this challenge.</td>', 'The softness and lighting gives this shot a great dreamy feel to it. Very ncie work. Bumping up. Back to bump up one more time - my top pick of this challenge.', '2006-08-29 23:11:14.000000', NULL, 1),
