(2773291, 383717, 61191, '<td valign="top">This should have ranked higher IMHO! Don''t know what people dislike here. Composition, lighting, colors... everything worked perfect here. Perhaps you could have placed the glass nearer to you camera to blur out the vaseline. And lights in front of the glass might have made the vaseline look a bit ''harsh''. But I''m not an expert in those techniques, don''t trust me ;) Anyway: I thought this would end up in the top 10.<br/> <br/>"Fat face"? No way! You are beautiful! Your lips are seducing :)</td>', 'This should have ranked higher IMHO! Don''t know what people dislike here. Composition, lighting, colors... everything worked perfect here. Perhaps you could have placed the glass nearer to you camera to blur out the vaseline. And lights in front of the glass might have made the vaseline look a bit ''harsh''. But I''m not an expert in those techniques, don''t trust me ;) Anyway: I thought this would end up in the top 10. "Fat face"? No way! You are beautiful! Your lips are seducing :)', '2006-08-30 06:38:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(2773453, 382039, 16938, '<td valign="top">This is my second challenge and I really didn''t think this photo would do so well.  I lurk quite alot on the forums and read the comments on challenge photos to learn more about composition, techniques, and such. Most folks are tired of seeing pet pics, so I appreciate everyone''s tollerance of the photo subject!</td>', 'This is my second challenge and I really didn''t think this photo would do so well.  I lurk quite alot on the forums and read the comments on challenge photos to learn more about composition, techniques, and such. Most folks are tired of seeing pet pics, so I appreciate everyone''s tollerance of the photo subject!', '2006-08-30 07:49:42.000000', NULL, 0),
