(2778356, 382368, 30861, '<td valign="top">Fine way to get your first ribbon, dude! Heartfelt congratulations! That said, I got a chuckle out of this part of your profile:<br/> <br/><i>Preferences:<br/> <br/>- I prefer black and white photography<br/>- I tend to like abstract images or images that let me draw my own conclusions<br/>- I prefer natural looking photos, PP''d enough to look good but not to the point of looking computer generated </i> <br/> <br/>Let''s see; it''s color, it''s not even remotely abstract, and the effect is 100% computer-generated :-) Funny how that goes, isn''t it? <br/> <br/>This is not meant negatively at all, seriously, it just made me chuckle at how that goes :-) Love the picture, well-deserved blue.<br/> <br/>R.</td>', 'Fine way to get your first ribbon, dude! Heartfelt congratulations! That said, I got a chuckle out of this part of your profile: Preferences: - I prefer black and white photography- I tend to like abstract images or images that let me draw my own conclusions- I prefer natural looking photos, PP''d enough to look good but not to the point of looking computer generated   Let''s see; it''s color, it''s not even remotely abstract, and the effect is 100% computer-generated :-) Funny how that goes, isn''t it?  This is not meant negatively at all, seriously, it just made me chuckle at how that goes :-) Love the picture, well-deserved blue. R.', '2006-08-31 11:05:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(2778469, 382124, 50531, '<td valign="top">Nice set up and Idea like the thought behind it..]<br/>take care</td>', 'Nice set up and Idea like the thought behind it..]take care', '2006-08-31 11:45:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(2778561, 383257, 5112, '<td valign="top">Congratulations.</td>', 'Congratulations.', '2006-08-31 12:25:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(2778573, 384130, 62009, '<td valign="top"><b>Greets from the Critique Club</b> <br/> <br/>First off, let me congratulate you on your photo.  I loved this, as you probably saw from my original comment.  I gave this an 8 to start with.<br/> <br/>The colors are amazing and the focus couldn''t be better, in my opinion. <br/> <br/>My only complaint is the border. Firstly, I''m not a big fan of borders, but I''m not against them either.  My issue with the border is that your photo shows through it.  So, instead of it being a true border, it''s various shades of pink around the edge that you can see through.<br/> <br/>Again, I loved the shot.<br/> <br/>If you have any questions or comments on this critique, feel free to PM me.  And remember to click "This comment was helpful" if it truly was.<br/> <br/>--Mike</td>', 'Greets from the Critique Club  First off, let me congratulate you on your photo.  I loved this, as you probably saw from my original comment.  I gave this an 8 to start with. The colors are amazing and the focus couldn''t be better, in my opinion.  My only complaint is the border. Firstly, I''m not a big fan of borders, but I''m not against them either.  My issue with the border is that your photo shows through it.  So, instead of it being a true border, it''s various shades of pink around the edge that you can see through. Again, I loved the shot. If you have any questions or comments on this critique, feel free to PM me.  And remember to click "This comment was helpful" if it truly was. --Mike', '2006-08-31 12:31:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(2778583, 382039, 16938, '<td valign="top">Thank you for the kind comments.  Suemack, both my husband and I have prints of this at work now, and our coworkers can''t stop cooing...  <br/> <br/>Seriously, I''ve learned quite alot from the comments from this community, and I have so much to work on and learn. :)</td>', 'Thank you for the kind comments.  Suemack, both my husband and I have prints of this at work now, and our coworkers can''t stop cooing...   Seriously, I''ve learned quite alot from the comments from this community, and I have so much to work on and learn. :)', '2006-08-31 12:35:25.000000', NULL, 0),
