(2781835, 382418, 23458, '<td valign="top">Yes, the soft focus effect here is subtle, but it''s there - who cares if it''s accomplished via the use of a wide open aperture, a filter, or in post-processing. This seems to be a new style of photography for you, but I think you''ve definately pulled it off. <br/> <br/>Oh... and the red-blooded male in me feels somehow compelled to add that she does indeed have a great body!</td>', 'Yes, the soft focus effect here is subtle, but it''s there - who cares if it''s accomplished via the use of a wide open aperture, a filter, or in post-processing. This seems to be a new style of photography for you, but I think you''ve definately pulled it off.  Oh... and the red-blooded male in me feels somehow compelled to add that she does indeed have a great body!', '2006-09-01 06:06:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(2781838, 382418, 23458, '<td valign="top">PS - I wonder whether the eight ones came from the prudes, or the folks that don''t think it met the challenge ?</td>', 'PS - I wonder whether the eight ones came from the prudes, or the folks that don''t think it met the challenge ?', '2006-09-01 06:07:01.000000', NULL, 0),
