(2782589, 382682, 3724, '<td valign="top">I think very good colour edit &amp; soft focus effect complement one another very well.  Beautiful album picture. fyi 8.</td>', 'I think very good colour edit & soft focus effect complement one another very well.  Beautiful album picture. fyi 8.', '2006-09-01 10:04:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(2782725, 381955, 63163, '<td valign="top">Thanks to those who commented.  I totally agree that it needs to be cropped and found those suggestions helpful.  I was hoping for at least a "5" and I got a 5.118, so I''m happy :)  I just wish those who voted below a 5 would of left a comment on what I could do to improve and why they thought it deserved what they gave.</td>', 'Thanks to those who commented.  I totally agree that it needs to be cropped and found those suggestions helpful.  I was hoping for at least a "5" and I got a 5.118, so I''m happy :)  I just wish those who voted below a 5 would of left a comment on what I could do to improve and why they thought it deserved what they gave.', '2006-09-01 10:41:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(2783395, 382709, 554, '<td valign="top">Oh what a lovely daisy. I do however prefer yellow daisies.<br/>If you had chosen a perfect specimen rather than one with a damaged petal I would have voted it much higher.  Remember, when doing a still life, only a perfect, flawless specimen will do, even when using soft focus.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-09-01 11:44:16.</i></td>', 'Oh what a lovely daisy. I do however prefer yellow daisies.If you had chosen a perfect specimen rather than one with a damaged petal I would have voted it much higher.  Remember, when doing a still life, only a perfect, flawless specimen will do, even when using soft focus.', '2006-09-01 12:23:34.000000', '2006-09-01 12:44:16.000000', 0),
(2783438, 382728, 48471, '<td valign="top">A piece of art.</td>', 'A piece of art.', '2006-09-01 12:31:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(2783636, 383157, 19708, '<td valign="top">One of the most artistic entries in the challenge.<br/>Shame about the 1''s &amp; 2''s - this was tastefully done with a high level of quality, certainly well-fitting to the challenge, and should have ranked much higher in my opinion.</td>', 'One of the most artistic entries in the challenge.Shame about the 1''s & 2''s - this was tastefully done with a high level of quality, certainly well-fitting to the challenge, and should have ranked much higher in my opinion.', '2006-09-01 13:26:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(2784416, 381405, 47482, '<td valign="top">love the colour!</td>', 'love the colour!', '2006-09-01 16:12:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(2785136, 383654, 62187, '<td valign="top">''Soft Focus'' was a struggle for a lot of us I think - myself included. It was a learning experience for sure. Welcome to the insanity!</td>', '''Soft Focus'' was a struggle for a lot of us I think - myself included. It was a learning experience for sure. Welcome to the insanity!', '2006-09-01 19:22:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(2786104, 382973, 30982, '<td valign="top">I quite like this, Kelli, and am quite surprised by the score.  Apparently I have lousy taste since I think this is a very nice shot.  I like that his expression is pefectly natural.  Looking through the comments, I guess people didn''t see this as "soft focus" but I''ll admit I''m not entirely sure what that is.  The shot looks soft to me, but not fuzzy - what do I know?  I still like it.</td>', 'I quite like this, Kelli, and am quite surprised by the score.  Apparently I have lousy taste since I think this is a very nice shot.  I like that his expression is pefectly natural.  Looking through the comments, I guess people didn''t see this as "soft focus" but I''ll admit I''m not entirely sure what that is.  The shot looks soft to me, but not fuzzy - what do I know?  I still like it.', '2006-09-01 23:22:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(2786108, 381559, 11854, '<td valign="top">Trading post...<br/>  I gave this a 6 in voting. After reading your comments I realize you didn''t pick your models. LOL. I thought it was weird to have that purse in there. Otherwise it would look just like a tropical rain forest with some indigenous people emerging from the mist.</td>', 'Trading post...  I gave this a 6 in voting. After reading your comments I realize you didn''t pick your models. LOL. I thought it was weird to have that purse in there. Otherwise it would look just like a tropical rain forest with some indigenous people emerging from the mist.', '2006-09-01 23:24:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(2786150, 381559, 30982, '<td valign="top">Another 6+ in another challenge I didn''t vote it.  Hmmm... maybe there''s a connection... (j/k)  I like the pink.  Not sure why it''s pink but it''s kinda nice that way.  Only thing I don''t like is the purse, but what are you gonna do about that?</td>', 'Another 6+ in another challenge I didn''t vote it.  Hmmm... maybe there''s a connection... (j/k)  I like the pink.  Not sure why it''s pink but it''s kinda nice that way.  Only thing I don''t like is the purse, but what are you gonna do about that?', '2006-09-01 23:43:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(2787011, 383257, 11897, '<td valign="top">Excellent, congrats on the ribbon Jason.<br/></td>', 'Excellent, congrats on the ribbon Jason.', '2006-09-02 07:27:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(2787762, 382658, 11854, '<td valign="top">I like the set up of this very much. Very simple and to the point. The green bokeh goes well with the green of the plant as well. What probably hurt you in scoring is the sharpness of the beginning leaves. Overall, a good job that deserved a better score. <br/></td>', 'I like the set up of this very much. Very simple and to the point. The green bokeh goes well with the green of the plant as well. What probably hurt you in scoring is the sharpness of the beginning leaves. Overall, a good job that deserved a better score. ', '2006-09-02 11:30:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(2788817, 384094, 57936, '<td valign="top">Very nicely composed, but I have to agree that the shoes distract, especially what they do to her backside. I would also dispense with the thong and spread the knees to balance the bottom of the image better.<br/> <br/>It appears that there are some prudes voting based on the ratings of the nudes in this set!</td>', 'Very nicely composed, but I have to agree that the shoes distract, especially what they do to her backside. I would also dispense with the thong and spread the knees to balance the bottom of the image better. It appears that there are some prudes voting based on the ratings of the nudes in this set!', '2006-09-02 16:15:22.000000', NULL, 0),
