(2795581, 383785, 46782, '<td valign="top">This was my first place vote!!! I love this shot and in my opinion is still #1! Good job.</td>', 'This was my first place vote!!! I love this shot and in my opinion is still #1! Good job.', '2006-09-04 10:32:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(2796770, 383468, 3936, '<td valign="top">Critique Club Review:<br/> <br/>I''m no prude, and nudity does not offend me.  I''m just not sure what the nudity is saying here.  To really work, the entire piece has to stay on message.  I like the juxtaposition of the sharply defined hand, with the soft focus of the rest of the picture.  The soft focus looks almost as if it were sharpened after it was taken, as it does appear to be a bit grainy.  I like your idea of going against tradition, usually soft focus images are dreamy, romantic, fairy tale, type efforts.  Yours is the opposite, which is a good start.  Each element just needs a reason, and to reinforce the message of the others.  Good lighting, and contrast.  The colors are almost like a sepia photo, which works well here.</td>', 'Critique Club Review: I''m no prude, and nudity does not offend me.  I''m just not sure what the nudity is saying here.  To really work, the entire piece has to stay on message.  I like the juxtaposition of the sharply defined hand, with the soft focus of the rest of the picture.  The soft focus looks almost as if it were sharpened after it was taken, as it does appear to be a bit grainy.  I like your idea of going against tradition, usually soft focus images are dreamy, romantic, fairy tale, type efforts.  Yours is the opposite, which is a good start.  Each element just needs a reason, and to reinforce the message of the others.  Good lighting, and contrast.  The colors are almost like a sepia photo, which works well here.', '2006-09-04 15:05:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(2796823, 383157, 3936, '<td valign="top">Critique Club Review:<br/> <br/>What''s not to like here.  I don''t get all the 1''s and 2''s for this piece.  If a person is offended by nudity, simply abstain, don''t vote, pass on by.  That also goes for political views etc.  Sorry - soap box mode off...<br/> <br/>I love your use of negative space here.  It adds to the mood and mystery of the picture.  The model winds up floating in the negative space, very well done sir.  Lighting, contrast, exposure are all spot on.  This picture should have scored much higher.</td>', 'Critique Club Review: What''s not to like here.  I don''t get all the 1''s and 2''s for this piece.  If a person is offended by nudity, simply abstain, don''t vote, pass on by.  That also goes for political views etc.  Sorry - soap box mode off... I love your use of negative space here.  It adds to the mood and mystery of the picture.  The model winds up floating in the negative space, very well done sir.  Lighting, contrast, exposure are all spot on.  This picture should have scored much higher.', '2006-09-04 15:19:55.000000', NULL, 0),
