(2842530, 382973, 53147, '<td valign="top">I gave this a 6 in challenge. Maybe a bit blurry rather than soft focus, but there were several aspects of this that I did like. The angle of the boy and his placement in the pic work well. The colors are nice both on the boy and the background. I think your score was too low - this should have easily broke 5.</td>', 'I gave this a 6 in challenge. Maybe a bit blurry rather than soft focus, but there were several aspects of this that I did like. The angle of the boy and his placement in the pic work well. The colors are nice both on the boy and the background. I think your score was too low - this should have easily broke 5.', '2006-09-17 13:51:32.000000', NULL, 0),
